Command: R
Effect : search and replace
Modes  : x, x-y, x@y

Examples:
R 5 <old> <new>    - search for <old> on next 5 lines & replace with <new>
R 3-10 <old> <new> - search for <old> on lines 3-10 & replace with <new>
R 6@50 <old> <new> - search for <old> on 6 lines starting at line 50 and
                     replace with <new>

Also see the help on strings.
